<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Q2 '97 jobless rate 8.5 pct - govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Q2 '97 jobless rate 8.5 pct - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello revised the government's forecast for the June quarter 1997 unemployment rate to 8.50 percent from the 8.25 percent forecast in the August budget.</p>
<p>Costello issued the forecast as part of the government's regular mid-year review of budget projections.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
